[Audio:reward-tune:Reward Tune]
Played by #R$BB3A when the player is given the reward for the outlaw.
The music data is at #R$B0A9.

#AUDIO0(reward-tune.wav)(#INCLUDE(RewardTune))

[Audio:start-game-tune:Start Game Tune]
Played by #R$AC6A when key 3 is pressed on the title screen.
The music data is at #R$B0C9.

#AUDIO0(start-game-tune.wav)(#INCLUDE(StartGameTune))

[Audio:title-tune:Title Tune]
Played by #R$AC6A on the title screen once all three revolvers have fired.
The music data is at #R$B0D3.

#AUDIO0(title-tune.wav)(#INCLUDE(TitleTune))

[Audio:outlaw-shot-tune:Outlaw Shot Tune]
Played by #R$B2E9 when the outlaw has been shot.
The music data is at #R$B1B5.

#AUDIO0(outlaw-shot-tune.wav)(#INCLUDE(OutlawShotTune))

[Audio:game-over-tune:Game Over Tune]
